Patch 1: patch1┃Patch 2: patch2
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Patch mode: comparisons use
only the source lines quoted in
the patches.

═══════════════════════════════
*    DELTA DIFFERENCES        *
═══════════════════════════════
Signs mark edits made by only
that patch. A sign-less line
with one number is an edit both
patches make: a new number
means both add it, an old
number means both remove it.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
 old new│a/x.c ┃ old new│a/x.c
        │@@    ┃        │@@
-  1    │old   ┃        │
+      1│first ┃        │

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
 old new│x.c   ┃ old new│x.c
        │      ┃        │Create
        │      ┃        │ file
        │      ┃        │New mo
        │      ┃        │de: 10
        │      ┃        │0644
        │@@    ┃        │@@
        │      ┃+      1│second
